The Elders are the ruling body of [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|Brejvasing]]. The council of the six patriarchs and matriarchs of the largest families in the Leviathan meets in [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/Kryperkyst|Kryperkyst]] to debate on new laws and policies for the country -- since its founding the group has maintained a strict isolationist policy to keep the Leviathan's secrets safe from outside countries.
